# Default: let git auto-detect text vs binary, normalize line endings to LF
# in the repo, and check out with LF on all platforms.
#
# This prevents the "phantom diff" problem where opening a file in a Windows
# editor (or PowerShell tools that default to UTF-16 LE w/ BOM) flips every
# line's ending and git shows every file as modified.
#
# If individual file types ever need explicit handling, add them below.
* text=auto eol=lf
